 "hook-2": {
  "start": 253,
  "duration": 361,
  "audioFrames": 351,
  "audioSec": 11.7,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 253,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "可很多网站还要在数据库前面，再存一份常用的数据，这一份在技术上叫服务端缓存。",
    "start": -0.007,
    "dur": 8.201
   },
   {
    "text": "东西明明都在，为什么还要多存一份？",
    "start": 8.474,
    "dur": 3.24
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep8-timing.json:hook-2"
 },
 "no-cache-1": {
  "start": 614,
  "duration": 265,
  "audioFrames": 257,
  "audioSec": 8.567,
  "chapter": "warehouse",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "先看没有这一份会怎样。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 1.567
   },
   {
    "text": "每来一个点单，厨师都要跑去后面的大仓库，找到食材，再现切现配，才能出菜。",
    "start": 1.847,
    "dur": 6.717
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep8-timing.json:no-cache-1"
 },
 "no-cache-2": {
  "start": 879,
  "duration": 399,
  "audioFrames": 389,
  "audioSec": 12.967,
  "chapter": "warehouse",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 265,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "客人少的时候还行，一到饭点，仓库门口挤满了厨师，谁都快不起来。",
    "start": 0.012,
    "dur": 6.09
   },
   {
    "text": "网站也是这样：每个请求都去查数据库，人一多，数据库就被压慢了。",
    "start": 6.381,
    "dur": 6.595
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep8-timing.json:no-cache-2"
 },
 "hit-miss-1": {
