 "ttl-2": {
  "start": 2240,
  "duration": 425,
  "audioFrames": 415,
  "audioSec": 13.833,
  "chapter": "ttl",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 91,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "切好的菜放久了也会不新鲜，所以每份都要定一个过期时间，技术上叫 TTL，时间一到就撤掉，下次有人点再重新备。",
    "start": 0.009,
    "dur": 9.967
   },
   {
    "text": "这样台上既不会堆满，放的也都是比较新的。",
    "start": 10.256,
    "dur": 3.593
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep8-timing.json:ttl-2"
 },
